          "jcr:created": "Thu Jan 21 2021 19:15:16 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Standardize</span> </span><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">your care</span></span><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"> </span></span><br>\n<br>\n<span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">We partner with home health agencies to provide solutions that enable simple standardized care protocols. Our clinically proven products enable caregivers to provide care consistently, efficiently and safely for all their patients. Streamline your care and choose a hospital-trusted brand to allow you to provide better care at home.<br>\n </span><br>\n</p>\n",
